From 188cbee1b73a6df418b2f00251e7f68e83085c8c Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: SMARK <3222301373@qq.com>
Date: Sat, 16 May 2026 16:52:33 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] =?UTF-8?q?feat:=20=E4=B8=80=E5=A0=86Bug=E4=BF=AE=E6=94=B9?=
 =?UTF-8?q?=20Enhance=20session=20handling=20and=20event=20publishing?=
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

- Introduced context-aware publishing in the bus module to include instance and workspace information.
- Refactored event handling in the TUI context to streamline event processing.
- Added session status refresh functionality in the sync context.
- Improved session management by ensuring commands and prompts are executed within the correct session directory.
- Enhanced error handling for assistant messages, including new reasons for hidden messages.
- Updated tests to cover new functionality, including session status updates and event emissions.

